==Acquisition==
{{Acquisition|Cascadia Accuracy can be purchased from [[Cavalero]] for {{sc|5,000}}, requiring '''Rank 1 - Fallen''' with [[The Holdfasts]].|header=no}}

===Farming Tips===
*Thrax enemies are abundant in [[Mobile Defense]] and [[Void Cascade]] missions.
*The Zariman Arcane drop is considered as a mod drop, and is thus affected by [[The Steel Path]] and [[Mod Drop Chance Booster]].

==Notes==
*Bonus is additive to mods such as {{M|Pistol Gambit}}.
*Bonus is additive to {{M|Pistol Acuity}}

